# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the checkout OS,
# matching .editorconfig's end_of_line = lf. Prevents Windows' core.autocrlf from
# producing CRLF locally while Linux CI checks out LF, which otherwise disagrees
# with `dotnet format` and other linters.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
